## Problem
Arabic Letters are rendered as separate shapes in MD>LaTeX>PDF files 
![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/16869933/211460687-a560a478-f225-4ffe-ac36-c4dd5220f19c.png)
[trypandoc.pdf](https://github.com/jgm/pandoc/files/10378849/trypandoc.pdf)

### Source Markdown File
```markdown
---
# dir: rtl
lang: ar
mainfont: Amiri
---
# سلام يا دنیا

مرحبا العالم
```

### Command Used
```sh
pandoc --pdf-engine=xelatex -s 'simple-arabic-markdown-with-yaml.md' -o 'simple-arabic-markdown-with-yaml.kinetic.pdf
```
Also
```sh
pandoc --pdf-engine=xelatex -s 'simple-arabic-markdown-with-yaml.md' -o 'simple-arabic-markdown-with-yaml.kinetic.tex
```
Then compiling using TexMaker/xelatex produces the same result. Also, using [https://pandoc.org/try/](https://pandoc.org/try/?params=%7B%22text%22%3A%22---%5Cn%23+dir%3A+rtl%5Cnlang%3A+ar%5Cnmainfont%3A+Amiri%5Cn%5Cn---%5Cn%5Cn%23+%D8%B3%D9%84%D8%A7%D9%85+%D9%8A%D8%A7+%D8%AF%D9%86%DB%8C%D8%A7%5Cn%5Cn%D9%85%D8%B1%D8%AD%D8%A8%D8%A7+%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B9%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%85%5Cn%22%2C%22to%22%3A%22latex%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22markdown%22%2C%22standalone%22%3Atrue%2C%22embed-resources%22%3Afalse%2C%22table-of-contents%22%3Afalse%2C%22number-sections%22%3Afalse%2C%22citeproc%22%3Afalse%2C%22html-math-method%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22wrap%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22highlight-style%22%3Anull%2C%22files%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22template%22%3Anull%7D) produces the same eventual results. The previous permalink shows the LaTeX but here is a copy of the produced LaTeX:
