**Tested Pandoc version?**
Pandoc version 2.19.2  and 2.17.1.1 (apt version on Ubuntu Kinetic)
OS: Ubuntu Desktop 22.10 and https://pandoc.org/try for latest release

## Previous Version Worked Correctly
For the same file and same command on Pandoc version 2.9.2.1 everything worked correctly. Here is link to the correctly rendered PDF file 
[simple-arabic-markdown-with-yaml.jammy.pdf](https://github.com/jgm/pandoc/files/10378910/simple-arabic-markdown-with-yaml.jammy.pdf)
Here is a screenshot of correctly rendered Letters
![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/16869933/211462843-906a9a3c-db0d-4637-876d-5096dc028949.png)
Here is a copy of the LaTeX file generated by Pandoc 2.9.2.1 that produces correct connected letter shapes.
